"| `+PV-Inverter.Fronius+`\n"
"| SunSpec\n"
"| Kostal\n"
"| `+PV-Inverter.Kostal+`, `+PV-Inverter.Kostal.Piko+`\n"
"| SunSpec\n"
"| KACO\n"
"| `+PV-Inverter.KACO.blueplanet+`\n"
"| SunSpec\n"
"| SolarEdge\n"
"| `+SolarEdge.PV-Inverter+`\n"
"| SunSpec\n"
